  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEPAQ - a platform for aquaculture development in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall programme goal is through CEPAQ create a platform for private investors that see an opportunity to produce tilapia for sales in the local market and thereby create jobs and increase food security.</narrative>
  </description>
